\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Current V4 result boundary. The seven-method untouched smooth comparison identifies Window as the strongest deployable method and shows negative static and oracle-gap contrasts. Across six abrupt/OOD families, \textsc  {Route-A}{} matches locked EWMA in the worst window rather than improving it, while fallback and recovery costs remain visible. Positive Phase~6C results remain Supplement-only. This 55-row evidence-frozen figure supersedes any broad CNN/FPGA performance reading of the older sections.}}{6}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
